subckt Main (VDD VSS VB1 VB2 VB3 VB4 Vin Vout)
C1 (net0 net5) capacitor c=1p
C2 (net5 Vin) capacitor c=1p
C3 (Vin net1) capacitor c=1p
C4 (net1 net2) capacitor c=1p
M1 (VDD net0 net4 net4) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M2 (net4 net5 Vout Vout) nch_ulvt_mac l=150n m=1 nf=1 w=1u
M3 (net3 net1 Vout Vout) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M4 (VSS net2 net3 net3) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
R1 (net0 VB1) resistor r=1k
R2 (net5 VB2) resistor r=1k
R3 (net1 VB3) resistor r=1k
R4 (net2 VB4) resistor r=1k
